- lib/OCP/Cmd/Apply/Drift.pm:1229
- lib/OCP/Cmd/Status.pm:531
- lib/OCP/Cmd/Init.pm:741 and :800
- lib/OCP.pm:235 (run_cli: check first whether its job differs, since it tells user errors from internal ones by the location)

